            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-xl",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>A good night’s sleep is one of the most powerful ways to restore your body and mind. Yet many people overlook a key part of sleep health: the air you breathe and the environment that surrounds you. At Blueair, we believe that creating a soothing, clean, and restorative bedroom atmosphere is just as important as having the right mattress or bedtime routine. <\/p><p>That’s why we’re proud to introduce two new innovations in our Sleep Collection — the DreamWell™ Humidifier and the Mini Restful™ Air Purifier.  <\/p><p>Thoughtfully designed to improve your sleep quality, each product blends Scandinavian design with science-backed benefits, helping you breathe, rest, and wake more naturally. <\/p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "s3"
          }
        },
