            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>DreamWell™ Humidifier: The Science of Sleep Meets Sensorial Comfort<\/strong><\/h4><p><\/p><p>Dry air can make it harder to sleep soundly — leading to congestion, irritated skin, and restless nights. The DreamWell™ Humidifier  helps maintain a comfortable, breathable atmosphere that supports restful sleep. <\/p><p><\/p><ul><li>360° InvisibleMist™ Technology  <\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><ul><li>Provides optimal humidity all night long with clean, mist-free hydration  A multi-sensorial design creates a soothing sleep environment that goes beyond simple humidity control. <\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><ul><li>With its easy-to-clean design, DreamWell™ is as practical as it is beautiful, blending seamlessly into your sleep space. <\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><p> By maintaining an ideal balance of humidity, DreamWell™ creates an environment that encourages deeper relaxation and supports your body’s natural overnight recovery- helping you wake up feeling refreshed and restored. <\/p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
