            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>Mini Restful™ Air Purifier: Fresh Air Meets Sunrise Calm<\/strong><\/h4><p><\/p><p>Sleep isn’t just about what happens while you rest — it’s about how you wake, too. The Mini Restful™ Air Purifier is the first and only purifier with an integrated sunrise clock, combining the benefits of clean air with natural light therapy. <\/p><p><\/p><ul><li>Fresh air dome technology delivers quiet, efficient purification right where you sleep. <\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><ul><li>A gentle sunrise simulation helps you wake more naturally, easing the transition from sleep to day. <\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><ul><li>Soft mood lighting and app-based personalization allow you to create a bedtime and morning routine tailored to your needs. <\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><p>This unique combination supports both your nighttime rest and your morning energy, all while keeping your bedroom air clean and healthy. <\/p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
