            "richtext": "<h4><strong>Make Sleep a Ritual with Blueair<\/strong><\/h4><p><\/p><p>Both the DreamWell™ Humidifier and the Mini Restful™ Air Purifier are part of Blueair’s mission to reimagine sleep wellness through better air. With beautifully designed, easy-to-use technology, our Sleep Collection helps you transform your bedroom into a sanctuary where your body can truly restore. <\/p><p>Explore the Sleep Collection today and discover how the right environment can change the way you sleep — and the way you wake. <\/p><p><\/p><ul><li>Fresh air dome technology delivers quiet, efficient purification right where you sleep. <\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><ul><li>A gentle sunrise simulation helps you wake more naturally, easing the transition from sleep to day. <\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><ul><li>Soft mood lighting and app-based personalization allow you to create a bedtime and morning routine tailored to your needs. <\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><p>This unique combination supports both your nighttime rest and your morning energy, all while keeping your bedroom air clean and healthy. <\/p>",
